This may not be the best place to post this, as most people here
don't use the MOO.

Anyways, le sipku'a *has no exit named gapru*, so its "exit_ok" flag
WRT to an exit named "gapru" is rather irrelevant.  The nearest room
with an exit named "gapru" is le ricyzdadi'u, which (1) you don't
own and (2) isn't set exit_ok.

If R, the great God Of Hesitation, meant for le ricyzdadi'u to
belong to you, he's going to need to fix that, or let me know to do
so.

